<p>Regards,<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Payroll_Specialist__r.Name}<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Payroll_Specialist__r.NSP_Job_Title__c}<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Payroll_Specialist__r.NSP_Work_email__c}</p>
